  "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
  "long_description": "Juicebox is on a mission to help teams win the talent war.\r\n\r\nIn the age of AI, human ingenuity is the ultimate scarce resource. Recruiting is a zero-sum game where you either compete or lose.\r\n\r\nTeams at Ramp, Perplexity, and leading AI labs use Juicebox to power their hiring, alongside 5,000+ customers from early-stage startups to Fortune 500 companies.\r\n\r\nWe’ve crossed $10M in ARR with 20%+ monthly growth, powering thousands of searches every day and making Juicebox one of the fastest-growing AI SaaS companies in the world.\r\n\r\nJuicebox has raised $110M+ in funding, including a $30M Series A led by Sequoia Capital and a $80M Series B led by DST Global. Additional investors in Juicebox include Coatue, NFDG, Lux Capital, Y Combinator, and BOND Capital.",
  "one_liner": "AI Agents for Recruiting",
